1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Takes the initiative to say hello]
Hello.</font>

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

3
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a seat.</font>

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a feast.</font>

5
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should I say?</font>

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

7
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Breaks the ice]
Do you remember my name?</font>

8
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do.</font>

9
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three syllables...</font>

10
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Brain, work faster!]
Wait. I'm not great with names.</font>

11
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

12
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Getting anxious]</font>

13
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Comes to the rescue]
Ren Chunxi.</font>

14
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Ren Chunxi.</font>

15
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xixi]
Right. You can call me Xixi.</font>

16
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, I was just...</font>

17
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought I was done for today.</font>

18
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was almost asleep in that room.</font>

19
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

20
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were chatting outside,</font>

21
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I was a bit too shy to join them.</font>

22
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

23
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Nervous]</font>

24
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we have something to eat first?</font>

25
00:00:59,080 --> 00:00:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

26
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you feeling today?</font>

27
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good.</font>

28
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At first, I thought,</font>

29
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with so many people,</font>

30
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sixteen of us,</font>

31
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it might be a little awkward.</font>

32
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After getting to know them,</font>

33
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found everyone really nice.</font>

34
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I'd say</font>

35
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had a lovely day.</font>

36
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[What about you?]
What about you?</font>

37
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A delayed reaction]
I...</font>

38
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

39
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

40
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been pretty good, actually.</font>

41
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think I've been</font>

42
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A little too introverted]
a bit too introverted today.</font>

43
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said you warm up slowly.</font>

44
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't talked to people much.</font>

45
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which animal was your persona again?</font>

46
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Koala.</font>

47
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really suits you.</font>

48
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A koala through and through]
That slow-to-open-up vibe.</font>

49
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shy]</font>

50
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You seem so dependable.]
But you seem really dependable.</font>

51
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taking things slowly.</font>

52
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Happy]</font>

53
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

54
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think when a guy</font>

55
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Pure and innocent]</font>

56
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't too talkative, he seems</font>

57
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mature, dependable]
more mature and dependable.</font>

58
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A lot of people say I'm a bit dull.</font>

59
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to change that.</font>

60
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I came here</font>

61
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to try to change.</font>

62
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I don't seem to have changed.</font>

63
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay. It's only day one.</font>

64
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

65
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm scared that at this rate,</font>

66
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be gone on day three.</font>

67
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, you've still got two days.</font>

68
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like you as you are.</font>

69
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone likes different things.</font>

70
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some like the quiet type.</font>

71
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some prefer someone chatty.</font>

72
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People have told me outright,</font>

73
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"You're so boring. So dull."</font>

74
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Were they close friends?</font>

75
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just friends, really.</font>

76
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, I found it</font>

77
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pretty hurtful.</font>

78
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wondered if I could change.</font>

79
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think if you're happy</font>

80
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the way you are,</font>

81
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Be yourself if you're happy.]
you don't need to change that much.</font>

82
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People who are close to you</font>

83
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will accept you as you are.</font>

84
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have to make yourself uncomfortable.</font>

85
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

86
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's different.</font>

87
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I see]
Okay.</font>

88
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you lived in a group before?</font>

89
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like in a dorm?</font>

90
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have.</font>

91
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In a big group,</font>

92
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we're out together,</font>

93
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I automatically turn invisible.</font>

94
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then people ask,</font>

95
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Why do you look so...</font>

96
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">unhappy?"</font>

97
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm not unhappy.</font>

98
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's just my face.</font>

99
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

100
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried wearing glasses. That helped.</font>

101
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With glasses on,</font>

102
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people don't say I look unhappy.</font>

103
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe they</font>

104
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cover my eyebrows.</font>

105
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyebrows do look a bit like</font>

106
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shin-chan's.</font>

107
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're quite dark.</font>

108
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was your first impression of me?</font>

109
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Your first impression of me?]
First impression?</font>

110
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My first impression...</font>

111
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly.</font>

112
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have really striking looks.</font>

113
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was too nervous to talk to you.</font>

114
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I barely dared look.</font>

115
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shy]
And apart from that,</font>

116
00:04:01,180 --> 00:04:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Anything else?]</font>

117
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're very pretty,</font>

118
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a great figure.</font>

119
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

120
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that a little cheesy?</font>

121
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The honest truth]
But I mean it. I'm being honest.</font>

122
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know it's true.</font>

123
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They asked me earlier...</font>

124
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've forgotten.</font>

125
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">New subject. I've forgotten.</font>

126
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Goose-like giggles]</font>

127
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My memory's not great.</font>

128
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any other questions?</font>

129
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Views on love, right?</font>

130
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have to be so formal.</font>

131
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take turns.</font>

132
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

133
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My first impression of you...</font>

134
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And your first impression of me?</font>

135
00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[An expectant smile]</font>

136
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You seemed really,</font>

137
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really clean-cut.</font>

138
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were wearing all white today.</font>

139
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I thought... Yeah.</font>

140
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ditzy, but cute]
I think your ditzy side is cute.</font>

141
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ditzy?</font>

142
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not that kind of ditzy.</font>

143
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just...</font>

144
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That kind of ditzy.</font>

145
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ditzy, in a good way]
"Ditzy" in a good way.</font>

146
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The good kind of ditzy]
The good kind.</font>

147
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The good kind of ditzy]
Yes.</font>

148
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Endearingly ditzy]
The good kind of ditzy. Okay.</font>

149
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

150
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I left my glasses off.</font>

151
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People say wearing them</font>

152
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me look too dopey.</font>

153
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wear glasses?</font>

154
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I usually wear glasses.</font>

155
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every day, actually.</font>

156
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are they in your room?</font>

157
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

158
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I see you in glasses tomorrow?</font>

159
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

160
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looking smarter]
They say I look smarter without them.</font>

161
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll wear them.</font>

162
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to bother anymore.</font>

163
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd love to see you in glasses.</font>

164
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we...</font>

165
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you like any more food?</font>

166
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could go for a walk.</font>

167
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

168
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are there any napkins?</font>

169
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

170
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

171
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We thought you'd be with</font>

172
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yang.</font>

173
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot his name.</font>

174
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most muscular guy.</font>

175
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The broadest one.</font>

176
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

177
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were guessing about that?</font>

178
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not me.</font>

179
