they earn points.</font>

386
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Weibo: Gain or lose points in love?]
So looks are the starting score?</font>

387
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks...</font>

388
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,000
