415
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

416
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means you're not so shallow.</font>

417
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

418
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

419
