We really were meant to meet.</font>

496
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A cat has to choose a cat.]
One cat has to pick another cat.</font>

497
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

498
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

499
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many relationships have you had?</font>

500
