727
00:26:22,760 --> 00:26:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Choosing his words]
We just talked for a bit.</font>

728
00:26:25,840 --> 00:26:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't really like her?</font>

729
