731
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Getting impatient]
No, I mean, what's the reason?</font>

732
00:26:36,120 --> 00:26:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did her choose me?</font>

733
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her reason was</font>

734
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I was the quietest, most introverted guy,</font>

735
00:26:42,320 --> 00:26:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You had no choice but to pick me.]
so she had to talk to me more.</font>

736
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's it.</font>

737
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you're handsome.</font>

738
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

739
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If quietness counts,</font>

740
00:26:50,840 --> 00:26:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'd pick me. Honestly.</font>

741
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not shy.</font>

742
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He really is quite introverted.</font>

743
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:56,000
