Yeah.</font>

744
00:26:58,240 --> 00:26:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really enjoyed talking today.</font>

745
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She gave me a chance</font>

746
