749
00:27:08,320 --> 00:27:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was nice.</font>

750
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But tomorrow, I want to make a change.</font>

751
