<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gao! Gao!</font>

781
00:28:23,120 --> 00:28:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't be back tonight.</font>

782
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to get my bedding ready.</font>

783
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's funny.</font>

784
00:28:31,780 --> 00:28:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[How are you so cute?]</font>

