788
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm being sincere, but you won't believe me.</font>

789
00:28:48,280 --> 00:28:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your eyes look sincere,</font>

790
00:28:49,280 --> 00:28:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you've got a line for everything.</font>

791
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think?</font>

792
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think so.</font>

793
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the kitty heard that.</font>

794
