<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The cat is my witness]</font>

795
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at its eyes.</font>

796
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That look says, "As if."</font>

797
00:28:59,080 --> 00:29:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So dismissive after hearing that.</font>

798
00:29:00,560 --> 00:29:01,720
