805
00:29:11,280 --> 00:29:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like your outfit too,</font>

806
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that pretty little dress.</font>

807
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This kind of</font>

808
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">flora dress.</font>

809
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:17,880
