So adorable.</font>

810
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My cheeks are starting to feel warm.</font>

811
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Know what you're doing?</font>

812
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet-talking me.</font>

813
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you'd say I was fluttering like a flower.</font>

814
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I really am blushing a little.</font>

815
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're quite the smooth talker too.</font>

816
00:29:35,520 --> 00:29:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

817
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But every word I say is sincere.</font>

818
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

819
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, I really do.</font>

820
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like me.</font>

821
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come on this show?</font>

822
00:29:45,760 --> 00:29:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why join this show?]
I came on this show</font>

823
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because I really want a relationship.</font>

824
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Looking for a serious relationship]
It's been such a long time</font>

825
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since I've spent time with guys.</font>

826
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

827
00:29:54,800 --> 00:29:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

828
00:29:57,840 --> 00:29:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That I believe.</font>

829
00:29:59,040 --> 00:30:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the kitty's gone.</font>

830
00:30:00,240 --> 00:30:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? Your words scared it away.</font>

831
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What? You don't believe me?</font>

832
00:30:04,520 --> 00:30:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you.</font>

833
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do.</font>

834
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Which of your words should I believe?]
So which of your words can I believe?</font>

835
00:30:09,320 --> 00:30:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can believe every word.</font>

836
00:30:10,840 --> 00:30:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

837
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

838
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Swear it.</font>

839
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say you swear.</font>

840
00:30:18,600 --> 00:30:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every word tonight</font>

841
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,240
