842
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear.</font>

843
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything I've told you tonight is true.</font>

844
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more bite, then I'll go.</font>

845
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

846
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

