<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye. You can stay sitting there.</font>

853
00:30:50,320 --> 00:30:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing the romantic lead.</font>

854
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

855
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,400
