868
00:31:40,360 --> 00:31:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How was today?</font>

869
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good.</font>

870
00:31:42,760 --> 00:31:43,400
