871
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very happy.</font>

872
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course you're happy. You won.</font>

873
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were amazing.</font>

874
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wondering whether</font>

875
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd go on one date</font>

876
00:31:50,040 --> 00:31:51,040
