877
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd be sitting there,</font>

878
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you return.</font>

879
00:31:52,680 --> 00:31:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'd turn up again.</font>

880
00:31:55,320 --> 00:31:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great.</font>

881
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the stronger one.</font>

882
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A victory high five]
Let's raise a glass.</font>

883
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our cups of victory.</font>

884
