<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our victory cups.</font>

885
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers.</font>

886
00:32:02,800 --> 00:32:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers.</font>

